<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 6.384 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 6.384 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 6.384 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday through one single credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    6.384 bln  3 days</p>
<p>   *Amount in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
